PASS | fort-lee | FAQ JSON-LD == visible Q&A | page/src=[('Is Fort Gregg-Adams BAH different from Fort Lee BAH?', 'No. Fort Gregg-Adams was the post’s name from 2023 to 2025. Same post, same housing area (VA301), same rates. Petersburg (23805, 23803) and Hopewell (23860) are in it; DTMO calls the area RICHMOND/FORT LEE, VA.'), ('Does 2026 BAH at Fort Lee cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With avg 3-bedroom rent of $1,450–$2,000 and utilities of about $260–$530 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($2,358) lands between −$172 and $648 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2026 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')] | ref=[('Is Fort Gregg-Adams BAH different from Fort Lee BAH?', 'No. Fort Gregg-Adams was the post’s name from 2023 to 2025. Same post, same housing area (VA301), same rates. Petersburg (23805, 23803) and Hopewell (23860) are in it; DTMO calls the area RICHMOND/FORT LEE, VA.'), ('Does 2026 BAH at Fort Lee cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With avg 3-bedroom rent of $1,450–$2,000 and utilities of about $260–$530 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($2,358) lands between −$172 and $648 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2026 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')]
