PASS | joint-base-langley-eustis | FAQ JSON-LD == visible Q&A | page/src=[('Do Fort Eustis and Langley get the same BAH?', 'Yes. Fort Eustis (23604) and Langley (23665) both map to the HAMPTON/NEWPORT NEWS, VA housing area (VA297), as do Newport News (23606) and Williamsburg (23185).'), ('Does 2026 BAH at Joint Base Langley-Eustis cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With avg 3-bedroom rent of $1,550–$2,150 and utilities of about $265–$515 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($2,274) lands between −$391 and $459 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2026 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')] | ref=[('Do Fort Eustis and Langley get the same BAH?', 'Yes. Fort Eustis (23604) and Langley (23665) both map to the HAMPTON/NEWPORT NEWS, VA housing area (VA297), as do Newport News (23606) and Williamsburg (23185).'), ('Does 2026 BAH at Joint Base Langley-Eustis cover rent and utilities?', 'It depends on rank. With avg 3-bedroom rent of $1,550–$2,150 and utilities of about $265–$515 a month, a Sergeant (E-5) with dependents ($2,274) lands between −$391 and $459 a month after housing. These are planning estimates, not official figures.'), ('Do I get a different rate if I live in a nearby town?', 'No. BAH follows your permanent duty-station ZIP, not your home address.'), ('When do these rates apply?', 'These are the calendar-year 2026 rates. Rate protection keeps your rate from dropping while you stay at the same post with the same status; a PCS, a reduction in grade or a change in dependency status resets it. DTMO usually publishes the next year’s rates in mid-December.')]
